Cell["\<\
The containing composite is rebuilt without the deleted entries; a composite \
left with a single subdiagram normalizes to that subdiagram.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a145a727-df79-48e5-abb9-a4c936b7eb5c"]
}, Open  ]],

